# Copy this file to .env.local for local development.
#
# Cloudinary direct-upload config for the admin media uploader.
# Both values are PUBLIC by design — an "unsigned" upload preset is meant to
# be used from the browser; it is restricted server-side (in your Cloudinary
# dashboard) by folder/format/size, not by secrecy. Never put your Cloudinary
# API *secret* here — it is never needed for this flow.
#
# Setup (2 minutes, free tier):
#   1. Sign up at https://cloudinary.com (free tier is plenty for this site)
#   2. Copy your "Cloud name" from the dashboard home page
#   3. Settings -> Upload -> Upload presets -> Add upload preset
#        - Signing mode: Unsigned
#        - Folder: orangy (optional but tidy)
#      Save, then copy the preset's name
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_UPLOAD_PRESET=
